We think that we are a wholly superior people.

01:03:22.550 --> 01:03:27.210
If we'd been anything like as superior as we think we are, we would not have fought that war.

01:03:27.720 --> 01:03:29.960
But since we did fight it, we have to make it the greatest.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:37.520
war of all times, and our generals were the greatest generals of all time. It's very American to do that.

01:04:14.748 --> 01:04:17.208
In time, even death itself might be abolished.

